' Agentic Enterprise concept visualization
'
' Per CR-ES-010 §20 + ADR-ES-010 §1 + §3 + §17.
' Illustrates the Agentic Enterprise as a specialisation of Enterprise,
' with enterprise-level agentic participation ;;; bounded authority ;;;
' policy and governance ;;; and explicit intervention and escalation.
'
' Authored by: Emmanuel A. Otchere (cardinal author rule, 2026-09-24)

@startuml agentic-enterprise

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F0F8FF
    BorderColor #4682B4
    FontColor #000000
}

skinparam arrow {
    Color #2F4F4F
    FontColor #2F4F4F
}

title Agentic Enterprise ,  Enterprise Specialisation

rectangle "Enterprise\n(ES:CONCEPT:enterprise)" as enterprise #E0E8F0
rectangle "Agentic Enterprise\n(ES:CONCEPT:agentic-enterprise)" as ae #FFE4B5

rectangle "Agentic Value Stream" as avs #E6E6FA
rectangle "Agentic Operations" as aops #E0FFFF
rectangle "Agentic Workflow" as awf #F0FFF0
rectangle "Authority" as authority #FFFACD
rectangle "Policy" as policy #FFE4E1

enterprise --> ae : specialises

ae --> avs : enterprise-realizes-through
ae --> aops : enterprise-operates-through
ae --> awf : uses
ae --> authority : operates-within
ae --> policy : governed-by

note right of ae
  Per ADR-ES-010 §1 + §3 + AE-CON-001:
  Agentic Enterprise specialises Enterprise,
  not Agent, not Agentic Operations, not
  Agentic Value Stream, not Agentic Workflow.
  Per AE-NEG-016: Agentic Enterprise is
  orthogonal to Autonomous Enterprise.
end note

@enduml
